<title>UK: BOE allots 4.5 bln stg on UK money market repos.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 4.5 bln stg on UK money market repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England allotted a total 4.5 billion stg in repurchase and secured loan facilities at 5-23/32 percent for the UK money market.</p>
</text>
